Against the build it replaces
-----------------------------

The fun_amxx.dll H9 shipped before, from the reTS AMX Mod X build (1.10.0-manual):
154112 bytes, SHA256 4643E6FEE70D3B474E0A6CB35DFB5F666F85786E287B87A954EAB52945DF036B,
kept as fun_amxx.dll.bak_slots beside this file. To go back, copy that over fun_amxx.dll.

On servers of 32 slots or fewer nothing changes: the tables are longer, and every loop and
bound in them still stops at the server's maxplayers.
